# Literature review skills

This repository is the source of 17 literature-review skills (instruction packs for each review stage). A Cursor rule tells Cursor how to handle a project. Cursor loads installed skills, and this rule guides agents to in-repo paths and shared gates (yes/no checkpoints the human must pass before later stages unlock).

## Skills

Below are the 17 skills in this repository, each with its `skills/<name>/SKILL.md` entry point:

