## Routing

Read `skills/review-orchestrator/SKILL.md` first when deciding what to do next. Route to exactly one next skill per turn. Do not start a second skill in the same turn. Judge the current stage from `project.yaml` and `LOG.md`. An earlier unpassed gate beats a later existing file.

## Human gates

Gates are yes/no checkpoints before later stages unlock. Only the YAML boolean `true` in `project.yaml` counts as passed (`topic_lock`, `search_lock`, `inclusion_lock`, `outline_lock`, `journal_lock`, `final_submit`). The agent must not confirm a gate for the user. Each confirmation in `LOG.md` must end with `| human`. See `shared/gates.md`.

- `shared/gates.md`

