## Scripts

Helper scripts live under `skills/<name>/scripts/` when present, with matching tests under `skills/<name>/tests/`. Open your terminal at the repo root and run the pytest test runner:
```
python -m pytest -q
```

Some skill tests need pandas. CI runs the tests on several combinations of Python and pandas versions.
